<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-AU">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title><%= pageTitle %></title>
<meta name="description" content="<%= metaDescription %>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/connectivity.css">
<link rel="icon" href="/images/favicon.ico">
</head>
<body>

<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <span class="eyebrow">Products &amp; Services</span>
    <h1>Connectivity</h1>
    <p>Enterprise internet, SD-WAN and network security built on Australia's most connected network — so your business stays online, protected, and fast wherever you operate.</p>
    <a href="/contact" class="btn btn--primary">Schedule an obligation-free chat</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">

    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="section-head__copy">
        <span class="eyebrow">Max Uptime</span>
        <h2>On Australia's most connected network</h2>
        <p>Meet our Next Generation Network — the most connected network in Australia, with direct connections to the UK, USA, Europe, Japan, NZ, Dubai, Hong Kong, Shanghai and Singapore.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="feature-grid">

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2v20M2 12h20" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Unlimited NBN</h3>
        <p>We provide unlimited data over NBN — no download caps, no surprises.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2l8 4v6c0 5-3.4 8.4-8 10-4.6-1.6-8-5-8-10V6l8-4z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Threat Protection</h3>
        <p>Our network automatically detects and <a href="https://businessict.com.au/security">stops attacks</a>.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-6" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Highly Redundant</h3>
        <p>Our network automatically detects and <a href="https://businessict.com.au/security">stops attacks</a>.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 17l5-5 4 4 8-8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Real Time Insights</h3>
        <p>Access utilisation graphs of your network <a href="https://businessict.com.au/real-time-insights/">in real time</a>.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 12h16M4 6h16M4 18h16" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Carrier Diverse</h3>
        <p>Lower contention and dedicated bandwidth, Australia wide.</p>
      </article>

      <article class="feature-card">
        <div class="feature-card__icon" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6"/><path d="M12 2v4M12 18v4M2 12h4M18 12h4" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        </div>
        <h3>Seriously Connected</h3>
        <p>Get what you need faster — our network connects to more than 2,000 global content providers.</p>
      </article>

    </div>

    <div class="nbn-panel" style="margin-top: clamp(2.5rem, 5vw, 3.5rem);">
      <h2>Get Unlimited Data on NBN</h2>
      <p>Our network is the most peered network in Australia. That means reliable, fast internet connections for our customers — and it also means we can offer unlimited download limits over the NBN.</p>
      <p>While other networks need to direct data traffic through multiple different networks to get to where it needs to go, our network establishes a direct, one-to-one connection with content providers. The result is that many of our competitors cannot handle ever-growing data traffic demands and instead need to cap usage with download limits. Our network can handle the traffic.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="capability-block">
      <span class="eyebrow">Enterprise Internet, SD-WAN, and Network Security</span>
      <ul class="capability-tags">
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> nbn&reg;</li>
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Carrier Symmetrical Fibre</li>
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> 4G/5G Backup</li>
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Cisco Meraki Certified</li>
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Unifi Cloud Gateway Certified</li>
        <li><svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M3 8.5l3 3 7-7" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" fill="none" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg> Fortinet Certified</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>


<%- include('partials/footer') %>

<script src="/js/main.js" defer></script>
</body>
</html>
